:: Part 1 - CMD commands used in this lab
:: Run these in Command Prompt. Replace <YourUsername> with your Windows account name.

:: List files and folders
dir

:: Change directory
cd C:\Users\<YourUsername>\Documents

:: Copy a file
copy "C:\Users\<YourUsername>\Documents\file2.txt" "C:\Users\<YourUsername>\Documents\file3.txt"

:: Delete a file
del C:\Users\<YourUsername>\Documents\file2.txt

:: Print a message
echo Hello, World!
